Third-Party Protocol Specification Attribution
==============================================

The `protocol_xiaozhi` component in `bk-open-framework` is an independent,
clean-room C11 implementation of the public Xiaozhi WebSocket wire protocol
specification (JSON handshake/events, 60ms Opus binary audio framing, and
MCP JSON-RPC 2.0 tool-calling envelope).

Reference Protocol Specification:
- Project: xiaozhi-esp32 (https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32)
- Document: docs/websocket.md
- Upstream License: MIT License (Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Terrence / 78)

No C++ source code from `xiaozhi-esp32` is copied into `bk-open-framework`.
